========================================
  Milon API Server
========================================
  Listening on:  http://localhost:8080
  Default network: devNet
  Enable util sign: false
  Enable body log: false
  Endpoints:
    GET  /api/health                  - Health check
    GET  /api/chain-head              - Get chain head
    GET  /api/network/list            - List all networks
    GET  /api/network/current         - Get current network
    POST /api/network/switch          - Switch network
    GET  /api/accounts/:address       - Get account info
    GET  /api/accounts/:address/resources - List account resources
    POST /api/accounts/generate       - Generate new account
    GET  /api/transactions/:hash      - Get transaction by hash
    GET  /api/transactions/:hash/events - Get transaction events
    GET  /api/transactions/:hash/wait - Wait for transaction
    GET  /api/rpc/blocks/:height      - Get block by height
    GET  /api/rpc/resources/:hash     - Get resource by hash
    POST /api/rpc/access-value        - Get access value
    POST /api/read                    - Read contract (view)
    POST /api/read/multi              - Read contract (multi-view)
    POST /api/simulate                - Simulate contract
    POST /api/write                   - Write contract
    POST /api/write/multi-agent       - Write contract (dual sign)
    POST /api/write/multisig          - Write contract (split)
    POST /api/transactions/simulate   - Simulate raw transaction
    POST /api/transactions/submit     - Submit raw transaction
    POST /api/transactions/inspect    - Inspect raw transaction
    POST /api/util/address/derive     - Derive address from public key
    POST /api/util/key/derive-public  - Derive public key from private key
    POST /api/util/sign               - Sign message (requires ENABLE_UTIL_SIGN)
    POST /api/util/verify             - Verify signature
    POST /api/faucet/claim            - Claim faucet tokens
    GET  /api/faucet/balance/:address - Get MIL balance
    POST /api/view/single             - Low-level single view
    POST /api/view/multi              - Low-level multi view
    GET  /api/rpc/resource-paths/:hash- Get resource path by hash
    GET  /api/idl/metadata            - IDL 方法元数据（app/方法/参数 schema）
    GET  /                            - Web console
    GET  /static/*                    - Static files
========================================
